		{
			dependencies: ["7B955176F4E8579C"]
			description: ["The &6Cryogenic Plant&r, &6Heavy Water Plant&r, &6Tritium Removal Facility&r, &6Superfluid Helium Plant&r, &6Calutron&r and &6Pyroprocessing Cell&r take a mode each: para hydrogen, depleted protium, a polish, a solid target, new isotopes and titanium sponge. The older controllers and the isotope feeds. The polarised fuels, the titanium-50 bullet and the cold targets. Isotopes by bus; return the helium ash to the plant."]
