			description: ["The &6Coated Conductor Line&r, &6HTS Magnet Works&r, &6Naquadria Magnet Works&r and &6Nitride Magnet Works&r take a mode each: a gadolinium precursor, a seeded bulk magnet, a metallic hydrogen winding and a field-cooled coil. The older magnet controllers and the new windings. The Mk5 coils, the metallic hydrogen cable and the UIV cell. Windings by bus; keep the cooling lines separate."]
