		{
			dependencies: ["1BFA42734E29F4A9"]
			description: ["The &6Laser Sail Launcher&r, &6Starchip Fab&r, &6Antimatter Trap&r, &6Positron Accumulator&r, &6Tether Ribbon Works&r, &6Swarm Control Station&r and &6Warp Gate&r take a row for the era: relay seeds, probes, stored positronium, a crust tether, a Mercury swarm and the jumps. The stations you built for UHV and UEV. The jumps to the three dead stars and the swarm power at Mercury. Seeds and probes ride the relay; keep the bank sized for the gate's hold."]
